ps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l0JYr2iqwId6VOmCV8dHzlIM6Wd.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20833333333333334,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qhanotOZnOdgmCZonug5anT0mFo.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2018-04-29\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Alien Life\",\"overview\":\"From its earliest days, science fiction has asked whether or not we're alone in the universe. Steven Spielberg, Ridley Scott, Sigourney Weaver and others ponder the question: What can aliens teach us about ourselves?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4neV5uST7KDEKwPlZbAttCztxe3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"voteCount\":10,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-29\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Outer Space\",\"overview\":\"What does science fiction imagine about what waits for us in outer space - and how will those discoveries change who we are? George Lucas, Zoe Saldana, Jeff Goldblum and others share their thoughts and theories.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zMFL1tR135ECHH1sUQ0HpE4wQNQ.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Monsters\",\"overview\":\"From Frankenstein to Stranger Things, what terrifies us about monsters in science fiction? Guillermo del Toro, Ridley Scott, Milla Jovovich and others explore why we like being scared so much.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zFXJMouWaV7nMoLB6tTprBQJeJn.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Dark Futures\",\"overview\":\"Steven Spielberg, Christopher Nolan, Robert Kirkman and others explore what happens... when the world goes to hell? How does science fiction imagine the end will come about? And could I survive?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oX1u5QVtbTIDt2K5OLUHgC2qbB0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-20\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Intelligent Machines\",\"overview\":\"Technology is at the heart of science fiction. Steven Spielberg, Arnold Schwarzenegger, George Lucas and others attempt to answer the question: Will the smart machines that science fiction predicted save humankind or lead to our demise?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vRXvsJuKsHyXdJJ9OzGGWCGKmez.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Time Travel\",\"overview\":\"Christopher Nolan, Keanu Reeves, Christopher Lloyd and others take a look at how, in science fiction, time travel offers the chance to correct history's mistakes... while creating entirely new ones.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uCi5qvXycM8bjGUBXsIVxsGaJrn.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-05-27\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2018-04-29\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}